sists of taking the upper disk from one of the stacks and placing it on top of another stack or on an empty rod.\n- No disk may be placed on top of a disk that is smaller than it.\n\nYou can choose the number of disks between 3-8.", "short_description": "The Tower of Hanoi is a mathematical game or puzzle consisting of three rods and a number of disks of various diameters, which can slide onto any rod."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-policy-updated-at-2021-09-17.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-are-we-indie-virtual-reality-video.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26043535571929864"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1428241968686975_8875717401531790421_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O_qeg94fDtYQ7kNvwH_tnGS&_nc_oc=AdqWThzKKt8acdDPODKU8rOjI5cWT7PR3w0lSSk78MPNQpKnZ-Lq9Rs8PnQdsixwQmA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0GjubQlCnJK2WDmY9WXM6dD7Phlpb1DhiaPoMDsIYBaA&oe=69E8DC51"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Tower 